  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Within the framework of the International Decade of Indigenous Languages, UNESCO aims to enhance capacities of Member states, civil society, academic, public-private partners and UN system agencies to preserve, revitalize and promote indigenous languages. The activity will contribute to a coordinated implementation of the International Decade and legal recognition, enhanced functional use and transmission of indigenous languages.</narrative>
